<p><strong>Customer gateway</strong></p>

<p>AWS Site-to-Site VPN enables you to securely connect your on-premises ne=
twork or branch office site to your Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (Amazon VP=
C). VPN Connections are a good solution if you have an immediate need, and =
have low to modest bandwidth requirements. This connection goes over the pu=
