 Gateway are the components of an AWS Site-to-Site VPN.</p>

<p>A virtual private gateway (VGW) is the VPN concentrator on the Amazon si=
de of the AWS Site-to-Site VPN connection. A customer gateway is a resource=
 in AWS that provides information to AWS about your Customer gateway device=
.</p>

